OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry victim was kind and
OL,4,Aloving, say family
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who died at a property in
OL,7,FPortsmouth was a "wonderful mother,
OL,8,Fgrandmother and sister", her family
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FCarole Langley, 74, was pronounced dead
OL,12,Fat the scene after police were called
OL,13,Fto a "domestic incident" at a property
OL,14,Fin Cyprus Road on Monday morning.
OL,16,FIn a statement, her family said she
OL,17,Fwould be "sorely missed by everyone who
OL,18,Fhad the privilege of knowing her".
